aiproof (0.1.21) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changing the fallback provider now resets its endpoint and model to
    that provider's defaults, the way the primary provider already did.
    Without it the fields kept the previous provider's values and produced
    pairings that cannot work (claude-cli with an Ollama URL and model),
    which failed only later, when the fallback was actually needed.
  * find_claude_cli() ignores a URL in the endpoint field instead of
    treating it as a binary path, so a stale endpoint degrades to
    auto-detection rather than "Claude CLI not found".

 -- Ed Watson <edmundwatson@gmail.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:10:00 +0200

